	'kc1c91f39' => '30-day terms, credit up to €5,000, up to 5 named buyers',
	'kc208baa5' => 'Once your credit facility is approved, Mei Lin Hart issues your account number and prepares your trade counter cards. Your authorized buyers can begin charging materials immediately at the counter or reserve job packs in advance. Credit terms run thirty days from monthly statement, with an initial limit of up to €5,000 reviewed after three months of trade. If you have questions before applying, our team is available by phone at 0100 555 0142 Monday to Friday from 06:30 to 17:00 and Saturday from 07:30 to 12:00 at Unit 3, Brennan Yard, 41 Mill Road.',
	'kc491a0d3' => 'Our dedicated cutting bay cuts any length from five metres with zero cutting fee on account, letting you head straight to site with exact runs. A trade account provides thirty-day credit terms, access to our secure yard lockers from 06:00, and transparent wholesale pricing. Everything is organized so trade work moves forward smoothly.',
	'kc5f29bb3' => 'Privacy',
	'kc7f252f5' => 'Open a trade account',
	'kc840ad41' => 'Fittings picked by job',
	'kc9d9e01d' => 'The account process takes two working days from start to finish. Step one is submitting your application online or in person at the counter, which takes roughly ten minutes. Step two is our credit check, handled the same day by Mei Lin Hart in accounts. Step three sets up your counter card and records your named buyers by the next working day. Step four is placing your first order on account. There is no fee to open or maintain the facility, and credit starts at up to €5,000 on thirty-day statement terms.',
	'kc9e7c2bc' => 'Kairo Supply',
	'kcad7e752' => 'Apply online or at the counter in 10 minutes with your company name, VAT number, and one trade reference.',
