	'kd6d76bff' => 'Kairo Supply respects the privacy of trade contractors and account applicants. This statement outlines what data we collect to administer credit facilities, process trade orders, and verify account buyers.',
	'kd88b8e90' => 'We will call you within one working day',
	'kd8fe8c1b' => '€8 per pack',
	'kd9b04d37' => 'Once approved, your account number will be issued, activating thirty-day statement credit up to €5,000. Your named buyers can collect materials, reserve job packs for 06:30 collection, or arrange same-day van drops across Ostwick. Counter cards can be picked up on your first visit to Unit 3, Brennan Yard, 41 Mill Road. If you need urgent cable or fittings today, visit our counter or call Daniel Osei directly at 0100 555 0142.',
	'kda084524' => 'picked',
	'kda7ff7b6' => 'If your project requires specialist switchgear, heavy containment sizes, or architectural fittings outside our routine stock, we manage special orders directly through our manufacturing network. Stocked lines from partner warehouses arrive next working day at Brennan Yard. Non-stock special orders take three to five working days to reach the counter. Special orders carry a fee of €0 with a twenty percent deposit, ensuring you can source bespoke specifications without administrative friction.',
	'kdc0bc1a0' => 'Special order',
	'kdc56fd2b' => 'Picks and labels job packs for 06:30 collection.',
	'kdd2c3e57' => '/ Apply',
	'kde30daa0' => 'The counter is where a job starts',
	'kde37299d' => 'Trade accounts carry thirty-day terms from monthly statements and credit up to €5,000 at opening, subject to approval and reviewed after three months. Cable cut to length carries no cut fee for lengths from five metres. Job packs picked and labelled by job cost €8 per pack when ordered by 15:00 for 06:30 collection. Van drops within twenty kilometres are €15 for orders placed before 11:00. Cable drum deposits of €40 are refunded in full upon return. All prices exclude VAT.',
	'kde93733e' => 'Kairo Supply stocks six core equipment families selected for domestic rewires, commercial installations, and renewable projects. We source major manufacturers\' ranges and supply cable in standard sizes from 1.0 mm² to 35 mm².',
