	'kdfab5232' => 'Sockets, switches, boxes and glands from drawers at the counter.',
	'ke16dd6e1' => 'Prices',
	'ke1b74521' => 'Ruth Abernethy established Kairo Supply in 2004, building a steady trade counter where contractors deal directly with knowledgeable staff. Daniel Osei manages counter operations, Tomás Rocha oversees precision cable cutting, Mei Lin Hart handles accounts and credit checks, Jonas Weber runs midday van deliveries within twenty kilometres, Priya Natarajan manages lighting controls, and Aoife Brennan prepares early job packs.',
