	'ke69f4a68' => 'Weekdays',
	'ke758471f' => 'Trade accounts at Kairo Supply are open to electrical contractors and trade businesses operating in Ostwick and the surrounding area. An account sets up thirty-day payment terms, credit up to €5,000, and counter pickup for your registered buyers.',
