	'kea1839ed' => 'EV charging &amp; renewables',
	'kea8c3d1c' => 'Opening a trade account takes two working days through four straightforward steps. Apply online or directly at the counter in ten minutes using your registered company name, VAT number, and one trade reference. Mei Lin Hart reviews your details and runs a credit check the same day, establishing credit terms up to €5,000 and issuing counter cards for up to five authorised buyers by the next working day. Once registered, your team can order for same-day delivery or collect pre-picked crates from trade yard lockers starting at 06:00.',
	'keacad8c5' => 'How the four steps work',
	'keb2d1de0' => 'Call 0100 555 0142',
	'kebf06204' => 'We built Kairo Supply around the daily pace of electrical contractors who cannot afford wasted morning hours.',
	'ked5ed890' => 'We are testing online job-pack ordering to allow contractors to submit component pick lists directly from mobile phones. Join the early access waitlist to trial digital submissions ahead of general release.',
	'ked632ebb' => 'Job packs save you from gathering individual components at the counter. Send your pick list by 15:00, and Aoife Brennan picks, verifies, and crates your fittings and accessories so they are ready at 06:30 the next morning for €8 per pack. If you need materials before the counter doors open, your order can be staged in our external collection lockers from 06:00. You receive an access code to collect your crate, verify your delivery note, and head straight to your first installation of the day.',
	'kefc38950' => 'Priya Natarajan oversees our commercial and residential lighting stock, including LED panels, downlights, battens, emergency packs, occupancy sensors, and smart controls. Alongside lighting, we stock dedicated EV charging equipment, mounting hardware, protective devices, and solar connection gear for certified installers. Whether you are wiring a single domestic vehicle charger or fitting out commercial offices, our warehouse holds complete packages designed to match the current technical regulations and installation standards.',
